  "hints": [
    "Add from the rightmost digits, like column addition.",
    "Keep a carry. Each column's sum is 0-3: the digit is `sum % 2`, the new carry is `sum / 2`.",
    "i, j, carry = len(a)-1, len(b)-1, 0\nwhile i >= 0 or j >= 0 or carry:\n    total = carry + digit(a, i) + digit(b, j)\n    out.append(total % 2); carry = total // 2; i -= 1; j -= 1\nreturn reversed(out)",
    "One pass over the longer string: O(max(n, m)). Strings can be 10^4 bits, so converting to a long would overflow."
  ],
